agent-message-actions-not-run = I treated this as a message and did not run any actions. Queue a task if you want me to act on it.
agent-message-no-reply = I don't have a text reply for that yet.
agent-message-model-unavailable = I can't answer conversationally while my model is unavailable.
agent-message-reply-too-long = My model returned an answer too long to send. No actions were run; please ask for a shorter answer.
